WEBVTT

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:14.710
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.940
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.350
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.380
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:29.320
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.500
<i>ln order to prevent</i> <i>his Victor transformation,</i>

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:42.380
<i>Kazuki, along with Tokiko and Gota,</i> <i>headed to Newton Apple Girls School</i>

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>where Tokiko originally found</i> <i>the black kakugane.</i>

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.580
<i>Meanwhile,</i> <i>at the Alchemist Army Headquarters</i>

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.220
<i>the Re-Extermination Squad,</i> <i>along with the Victor Search Squad,</i>

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.230
<i>were being formed.</i>

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:00.600
<i>The Re-Extermination Squad,</i>
<i>Hiwatari, Negoro, and lkusabe</i>

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:04.260
<i>were confronted by Papillon</i> <i>who was also after Kazuki.</i>

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.700
<i>ln order to learn where</i>
<i>Kazuki was headed to,</i>

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.610
<i>Papillon battles lkusabe.</i>

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:25.360
<i>Hiwatari and Negoro soon caught up</i> <i>with Kazuki and the others.</i>

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:31.660
l have to move forward in order to return to everyone l care for.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.860
So please, move out of our way!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:40.400
<i>As Long As l Can Protect You</i>

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.380
So please, move out of our way.

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:52.210
Hell, no.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.190
Here he comes!

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.770
You're pretty good.

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:27.590
But it seems like you can't beat your exhaustion.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:31.320
My only desire is to become stronger.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:34.160
And to fight against one beyond a homunculus.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.890
l'm gonna soon put an end to this fight!

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.030
You don't get it.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.200
l now know the weakness of that spear.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.270
My Gekisen has no weakness!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.610
This rapid regeneration is unbeatable!

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.720
High speed and automatic means...

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:09.180
that you have no control over the speed or the timing.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.660
No matter what, it's going to immediately start the restoration.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.530
That's why...

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:17.730
Papi!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.360
Like this...

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:24.870
l can easily place a foreign object between it, and see?

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.080
Restoration failed.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.910
You bastard!

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:33.150
So, you want to fight one beyond a homunculus, right?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:36.110
l will fight you on the way back if l feel like it.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:45.620
Until then, save some more energy.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.560
You did it, Papi!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.070
Papi! Are you all right?!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.610
Super all right.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.510
lt's not time to strike a pose.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.640
That muscle man is gonna restore again.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:05.940
lt's okay.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:12.620
Although the main spear is unscarred, if it is away from his hand,

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:15.990
then he can't do the rapid regeneration.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.690
What do you mean?

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:21.130
The spear does not realize that there is damage.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.470
lf it doesn't know that it is damaged, then there is no way to fix it.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.330
ln other words...

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.910
l win!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:37.080
l didn't think you would do that knowing we might have both gone down.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.190
Both go down? Are you kidding me?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:45.480
No matter what it takes, l will reach Kazuki Muto.

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:49.990
ls that man...worth that much?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.430
Yeah. Now, a promise is a promise.

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:58.200
Let's hear where Kazuki Muto is going.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.200
Newton Apple Girls School.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.810
They are headed there.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:07.810
l see.

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.370
But l bet it is too late.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:11.820
What?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:16.750
Hiwatari and Negoro have already defeated them.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.630
That's the situation.
You heard too, right?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.700
Research it, Ohka.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:36.100
<i>Kazuki Muto does not die that easily.</i>

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.550
You should think over about using too much firepower, sir.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:54.890
Shut up! lt's always best to quickly take out persistent ones like those.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.190
Where are you going?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:02.860
l'm leaving. You find their kakugane.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:06.800
Understood.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.380
Who is he?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.050
He looks handsome.
He suits my taste.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:27.390
Shusui Hayasaka.
Until recently, he was an LXE.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.160
l see. l wonder if we can use him.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.550
Victor?

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:57.690
Yes.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:03.660
Our most important mission is the search for Victor.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.930
We need your power for that battle.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:09.730
Muto?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.370
ls Kazuki Muto also there?

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.470
He is...not.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.040
Muto...

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.810
lt seems like we found him.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.420
Victor!

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.560
They're here...

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.630
the Alchemist Warriors.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:47.630
Tokiko... Tokiko... Tokiko!

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:54.640
Great! You're conscious!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.180
Where's Kazuki?

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.590
Gota?!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:05.390
We can't find him...

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.990
lt seems like we were blown out in different directions.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.250
We must find Kazuki before the Re-Extermination Squad does.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.600
l can't be sleeping here.

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:18.590
Tokiko...

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:24.310
Please worry about yourself before you worry about him...

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.840
You directly received Hiwatari's attack.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:30.820
lt's amazing that you're even alive.

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:35.920
Let's go!

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.590
So you are alive.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.890
Where is Victor III? ls he alive too?

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.300
Wh-Where are you?!

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:55.000
lt's different from the initial target,

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.010
but defeating you is also part of the mission.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:02.870
Tokiko!

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:09.540
Tokiko!

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:11.780
Gota!

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.250
Where are they?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.990
You! Peeping Tom!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.600
Are you all right, Tokiko?

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.470
Don't bother with me!
He's gonna come!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.440
What are you aiming at?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:47.420
Ninja Sword Buso Renkin, Secret Trail...

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.130
Whatever this can cut becomes my secret path.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.660
Are you all right, Gota?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.090
l'm okay.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.860
Leave him to me.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:00.900
Are you gonna stand up for her?

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:07.450
Fine...it's easier for me to defeat opponents one by one.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:17.350
<i>Man...once he dives in,</i> <i>l can't see where he is.</i>

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.620
<i>Think. Where is he gonna attack from?</i>

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:25.830
<i>With that specialty, it's unlikely</i> <i>for him to attack from the front.</i>

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.130
<i>He's gonna aim for the blind spot.</i>

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.730
<i>ls it the back or from the bottom?</i>

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:33.570
<i>Or...</i>

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.230
Above!

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.800
Motor Gear! Knuckle Duster Mode.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.470
No! Look closely!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.010
A decoy! Then he is...!

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.490
Tokiko!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:55.960
Sorry.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:57.500
S-Sorry.

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:00.130
Hmm...they react well.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.300
Wait!

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:05.170
l'm not letting you go!
I'll dive in with it and...

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:10.970
Unfortunately, this path is only for me.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:16.910
No strangers, not even a rock can go through this path.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.280
Man...

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.120
Wait.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.120
Not even a rock...?

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:29.130
Then why are his clothes okay?
Are his possessions the exception?

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.620
Or...

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:34.860
Hey!

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.000
You were aiming for Tokiko from the beginning, weren't you?

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.870
That's a silly question.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:43.030
You said you'd protect the girl as you fight with me.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.540
So l accepted that.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.120
But l didn't say l would only focus on you.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:55.820
ln a battle, the point is to win.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.520
ln order to make that happen, l will take whatever means necessary.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.290
You aimed for Tokiko twice.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:08.460
I'll also use whatever means necessary!

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:09.930
Here l go.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:11.800
Come!

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.310
The next time you appear will be your loss.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:16.600
Here l go.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:20.740
Floating Mine Buso Renkin!
Bubble Cage!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:49.240
Bubble Cage increases in number as it explodes and pressures the space.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.710
Now! lnukai!

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:00.280
Go! Military Dog Buso Renkin,

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.280
Killer Rabies!

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.930
Sword Samurai X!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.650
This kid is pretty good.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.250
No...

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:34.120
Man! Not yet!

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:37.320
lt is dangerous to continue further.
For now, let us fall back.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:41.160
lt doesn't matter.
We should go to wherever we can.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.460
lf there are this many people, then even Victor will...

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:44.820
So wordy.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.500
Great Axe Buso Renkin.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:58.740
Fatal Attraction!

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.890
Wh-What is this...?

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.690
l can't stay standing.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.960
This is...gravity manipulation.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:20.060
All Alchemist Warriors should die!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:25.430
Gas Mask, Buso Renkin!
Aerial Operator!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:34.200
Everyone! Leave this place right now!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.370
Let's go.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.750
We're saved.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.610
How smart...

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:53.860
Hurry! Go!

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.340
Hurry! You too!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.480
They fled?

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:26.600
l knew it was the right choice to bring you along.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.060
lf we stayed back there, we could have been completely annihilated.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:36.140
That power... it's impossible for ordinary warriors to fight against him.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:37.710
You're right.

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:42.200
That Buso Renkin with gravity manipulation is a threat.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.550
But next time, we can bring the attack to him...

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:50.250
Since this radar Buso Renkin,
Hermes Drive,

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.480
is able to track Victor's signal.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.860
ls it really this way?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:16:01.390
There is no guarantee that Kazuki has reached Newton Apple Girls School.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:08.670
That lkusabe was quite strong, and aren't the other two after Kazuki?

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:10.830
They might have been defeated already.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.110
Papi! Are you all right?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.780
Super okay.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:23.450
Hey! Papi! Papi!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.290
Hey, are you all--?!

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.690
<i>lt's no use.</i>

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.460
<i>Gota got a hold of something, huh.</i>

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:39.030
<i>Motor Gear's damaging power is</i> <i>one of the weakest of the Buso Renkin.</i>

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Gota's battle style is to use strategy</i> <i>to compensate for that weakness.</i>

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.280
<i>When things click in Gota's head</i> <i>then he is... reliable.</i>

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:52.940
There!

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:54.990
Just the sword!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:57.850
This is?

00:16:58.520 --> 00:16:59.550
How is it?

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:04.460
The unseen attack from the inaccessible dimension.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:09.830
As long as you cannot intrude in, all you can do is defend yourself.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.170
This is the Secret Trail's style for absolute victory.

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:15.910
l'm gonna increase the speed.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:26.950
Gota!

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:33.420
Motor Gear, Skywalker Mode!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.090
Pointless.

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:39.760
Your attempt to escape is within my plan.

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:44.860
Where the lighthearted hope will soon reach a harsh death.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:50.670
Same as Victor III, Kazuki Muto, useless efforts that will not pay off.

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:54.370
<i>Don't treat me the same as</i> <i>that optimistic guy.</i>

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.750
<i>l don't care if he dies in pain.</i>

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:02.680
<i>As long as Tokiko is safe,</i> <i>l don't care about the rest.</i>

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.610
<i>As long as Tokiko is safe...</i>

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.520
As long as what we want to protect is the same,

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:09.420
then we can become comrades.

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:11.590
Man.

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.450
Hey Peeping Tom Ninja!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.490
What, droopy eyes?

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.060
Do you have a comrade?

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:22.630
Ridiculous. Whether l have one or not, they are useless.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.740
l can fight alone.

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:27.810
No matter how aware you are of your surroundings,

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:31.040
that sensitivity weakens in time of action compared to standing still.

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:32.210
l got you!

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:33.910
Motor Gear! Fire!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:34.980
What?!

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:45.130
You're tough. But l had more effect.

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.430
With the next attack...

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:50.440
The next attack... will be the end for you.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.700
This piece of your scarf helped me realize.

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:58.570
Although you said that not even a rock can enter,

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.310
your clothes and weapons are exceptions.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.210
The trick behind that pathway!

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:11.020
At first glance you can't tell, but look...
Your hair is woven into the fabric.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.390
By doing so, your scarf is recognized as a part of you.

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:21.200
The pathway's key is your DNA!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:23.060
l applaud you for figuring that out.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.560
But just knowing that will not get you in.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.070
That's--!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:38.010
Motor Gear covered in your blood.
Take that.

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:47.060
l can fight fully on my own too, you know...

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:54.930
Gota!

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:58.630
Where is he? Did you defeat him?

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:03.430
<i>Since what we want to protect is the same,</i> <i>l guess for now...</i>

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.570
lt was easy.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:10.580
l bet Kazuki is weakened, so let's hurry up and find him.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:18.080
Where are they...?
Are they both all right?

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:31.400
Captain...Bravo.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
lt's time to settle our score...Kazuki Muto.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.970
The time has come to settle the score between two who share the same feelings.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:52.610
The strong will of wanting to protect what's important drives them both.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:56.180
Next, "With Strength And Spirit."

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.450
I'll splatter your guts!
